edid_labels_changed.description:
{name} now offers a different list of EDIDs. Your own names follow the EDID they were given for, but the following ones no longer match the description they were given for. Each shows that description and the EDID it now belongs to, or – if it was removed because the matrix no longer offers its EDID:

{labels}

Check these names in the options of the integration and adapt automations and scripts that select one of them. Saving the options dismisses this message.
